    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In June 2016 SSM establish new cooperation programme with ONPU aiming in strengthening and improving of the ONPU educational program, at first hand concerning safety related issues. The main achievement in 2017 was that ONPU joined the OECD/NEA research project SCIP (Studsvik Cladding Integrity Project) as the representative of the Ukrainian consortium consisting of the leading Ukrainian nuclear research institutes, Energoatom and SNRIU, with support from SSM. The project is devoted to management of damaged fuel and improvement of reactor safety.</narrative>
